23461.d:
###
The Patchwork Gardern;
A mosaic of shapes and forms;
A tapestry of color.
###


This piece is something a little bit different. Basically, up to 12 points are chosen, assigned colors, and placed in random locations. Then, some movement rules are chosen, also randomly. After that, each pixel is given a color based on which point is the "closest" in terms of the generated movement rules. This leads to chaotic boundaries and mixed sections where the rules intertwine.
